{"root":{"data":{"id":"djlbxrpryr40","created":1782715597958,"text":"职业生涯","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkpre428bk0","created":1789965350624,"text":"前端开发"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkprgixnpk0","created":1789965355877,"text":"智驾测试","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkoqbw0er40","created":1789962446311,"text":"软件平台测试","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkponaqp2w0","created":1789965135527,"text":"性能稳定性","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkpp7d9bk80","created":1789965179215,"text":"测试体系","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkqelto8y80","created":1789967169786,"text":"1）性能&稳定性红线","expandState":"expand","note":"简单业务场基础指标检查"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkqjjnjpaw0","created":1789967556883,"text":"io","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkqjlm4p6o0","created":1789967561151,"text":"读写请求数量"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqlmlkh3c0","created":1789967720022,"text":"读写字节数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqls88b600","created":1789967732276,"text":"平均队列长度","note":"正在等待处理的 I/O 请求数量。队列越长，说明存储设备来不及处理，可能积压"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqmftr2w00","created":1789967783644,"text":"平均读写的块大小","note":"如果这个值很大，说明是以大文件顺序读写为主；如果很小，则说明是小文件随机读写"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqlwrrf080","created":1789967742164,"text":"平均响应时间","note":"包括了 I/O 队列等待时间和设备实际处理时间。如果 await 远大于设备正常的响应时间，说明 I/O 压力已经过载"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqm0gpydk0","created":1789967750204,"text":"设备利用率","note":"一秒钟内有百分之多少的时间该设备在处理 I/O 请求。\n\n对于现代可以并行处理的 NVMe SSD 或 RAID 阵列，即使 %util 达到 100%，也不一定代表存储带宽被吃满，它只代表设备一直有活干。真正的瓶颈更需要参考 await"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqf8l043c0","created":1789967219328,"text":"内存","note":"1、系统整体内存占用\n2、各业务节点内存占用\n\ntop工具\npidstat工具","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkqj0sis7k0","created":1789967515825,"text":"系统内存占用"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqj60bvao0","created":1789967527181,"text":"各进程内存占用"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqtwdg1yg0","created":1789968368212,"text":"内存增长曲线"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqy4x76480","created":1789968700277,"text":"线程占用"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqy89ki000","created":1789968707556,"text":"线程增长曲线"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqhjmr2740","created":1789967400107,"text":"cpu","expandState":"collapse","note":"perf工具\ntopgong'j"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkqhxqyjvc0","created":1789967430836,"text":"各核使用率"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqi5hbo9k0","created":1789967447668,"text":"各进程使用率"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqu179maw0","created":1789968378722,"text":"cpu增长曲线"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqyfxxou80","created":1789968724267,"text":"线程使用率"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqykwsvnk0","created":1789968735082,"text":"线程增长曲线"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrhlcmjw80","created":1789970224958,"text":"gpu","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkrhogvglc0","created":1789970231745,"text":"整体gpu占用"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrhvao5y00","created":1789970246607,"text":"业务进程gpu占用"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrhxq55so0","created":1789970251897,"text":"gpu增长曲线"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqlcbtyso0","created":1789967697666,"text":"网络通信","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkqleosfgg0","created":1789967702803,"text":"网卡的带宽","note":"网络链路在单位时间内能够传输的最大数据量（理论上限，通常单位为 Mbps 或 Gbps）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqolkbrdk0","created":1789967952863,"text":"网卡吞吐量","note":"在没有丢包和错误的前提下，数据实际通过网络链路的真实速率"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqp9wg03c0","created":1789968005838,"text":"丢包率","note":"定义：在传输过程中丢失的数据包占总发送数据包的百分比\n\n影响：网络拥堵或信号干扰会导致丢包。高丢包率会引发TCP协议频繁重传，导致网速断崖式下跌；在UDP应用（如视频通话）中则表现为画面卡顿、花屏或声音断续"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqqojdca80","created":1789968116064,"text":"延迟","note":"1、平均延迟\n2、单次延迟\n\n一般不超过200ms"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqrlyl8q80","created":1789968188818,"text":"进程管理","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkqrv03e740","created":1789968208500,"text":"进程启动","note":"版本迭代验证进程启动以及启动顺序"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqs491kgo0","created":1789968228632,"text":"异常恢复","note":"通过kill -9 等指令模拟进程异常退出，验证故障恢复能力"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqzwdc7q80","created":1789968838391,"text":"coredump","note":"进程异常崩溃监控"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkr4fh1ri80","created":1789969193430,"text":"启动时长"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkr4k6wx0o0","created":1789969203702,"text":"启动时序","note":"业务节点可能存在依赖关系，启动时序异常会导致业务崩溃"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkr1nfults0","created":1789968975680,"text":"状态机","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkr20bndo00","created":1789969003724,"text":"状态机切换","note":"验证是否切换成功"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkr2a59zm00","created":1789969025106,"text":"切换时长","note":"验证状态切换是否超过限定时长"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkr2d4l5qw0","created":1789969031595,"text":"各状态下的业务运行状态","note":"1、切换前后对应状态下的业务运行状态\n2、切换后系统资源占用"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dll453a32s80","created":1790005919681,"text":"磁盘分区&权限","note":"业务交付后为了安全会对磁盘进行分区和权限控制\n\n需要针对指定的磁盘、文件夹的读写权限 用户组权限进行验证\t","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dll46obdjog0","created":1790006043836,"text":"读写权限"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dll46quq0140","created":1790006049359,"text":"用户组权限"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqxwd3gog0","created":1789968681648,"text":"日志落盘","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkr0jnsi5k0","created":1789968889090,"text":"日志大小"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkr0m31kt40","created":1789968894364,"text":"日志量"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkr0qxhkkg0","created":1789968904912,"text":"日志等级"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkr764oogg0","created":1789969408184,"text":"ROS2 & DDS","note":"ros2多平台多节点通信、数据传输\nDDS发布订阅的通信标砖，负责底层通信，通过不同的qos策略保证通信质量","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkr7atrizc0","created":1789969418408,"text":"node、topic数量 名称"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkra6p0ui80","created":1789969644507,"text":"topic hz"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkravpmpls0","created":1789969698963,"text":"qos策略"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrbcpopn40","created":1789969735972,"text":"2）业务场景模型","note":"根据交付范围设计业务场景模型，补充数据，验证各种场景下的系统性能稳定性资源占用情况","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkrfs017m80","created":1789970082706,"text":"行车"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrft3diw80","created":1789970085084,"text":"泊车"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrftxgz9c0","created":1789970086904,"text":"adas"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqg6d934w0","created":1789967292870,"text":"3）极端工况","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkrdhsdskg0","created":1789969903747,"text":"高低温"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrdj04aq00","created":1789969906391,"text":"长时间"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrduaaasg0","created":1789969930951,"text":"高负载","note":"fio工具模拟文件读写","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkri588bm80","created":1789970268228,"text":"高io"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkriakepy80","created":1789970279848,"text":"高cpu"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrif69yls0","created":1789970289877,"text":"高内存"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrigmaygo0","created":1789970293023,"text":"高gpu"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrfiao7rk0","created":1789970061581,"text":"异常复位","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkrkj6upf40","created":1789970455348,"text":"断电重启"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrko7affs0","created":1789970466258,"text":"反复断电重启"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrks5t9eo0","created":1789970474876,"text":"模拟进程oom"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrh0oxj940","created":1789970179989,"text":"故障注入","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkrh3jabww0","created":1789970186179,"text":"传感器异常"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrhdb81xs0","created":1789970207459,"text":"电压不稳"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrisv9k3s0","created":1789970319687,"text":"网络中断"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkriv33fzk0","created":1789970324514,"text":"topic 异常字段","note":"none\n空\n超出字段设计范围"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrjte0m8g0","created":1789970399185,"text":"定位中断"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrldick000","created":1789970521347,"text":"初次启动"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrlgcv07k0","created":1789970527545,"text":"4）工具补充","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkrm04d0s00","created":1789970570567,"text":"ASAN","note":"用于检测内存相关问题，但对系统资源消耗太大 cpu和内存都会翻倍增长\n1、Heap/Stack/Global buffer overflow（内存越界/溢出）：数组越界、指针乱指\n2、Memory Leaks（内存泄漏）：程序退出时，内置的 LeakSanitizer (LSan) 会自动检查是否有未释放的内存\n3、Use after free (UAF / 悬空指针)：内存释放后仍然去读写\n4、Use after return：函数返回后，却去访问该函数内部的局部变量（栈内存\n"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkro57qsdk0","created":1789970738383,"text":"TSAN","note":"TSan 专门用于检测多线程并发程序中的数据竞争和死锁风险，内存cpu占用巨大，5-10倍左右\n\n1、Data Races（数据竞争）：多线程无锁读写同一变量\n2、Deadlocks（死锁）：由于加锁顺序不一致（如线程1锁A拿B，线程2锁B拿A）导致的潜在死锁\n3、销毁已被锁定的锁：锁还在用，却被销毁了"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrqyd67080","created":1789970958566,"text":"业务通信时延","note":"通过业务埋点，记录每个节点收到 DDS 数据 -> 触发回调 -> 算法执行 -> 再次发布 整个生命周期中处理时延\n\n可以发现诸如算法模型迭代、后处理逻辑变更、业务增删等带来的处理耗时"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkpovt7pa00","created":1789965154058,"text":"软件功能"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkps13gw4w0","created":1789965400654,"text":"ota"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dll47caliqw0","created":1790006096031,"text":"链路"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dll47dushoo0","created":1790006099429,"text":"云端"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dll481rsjrk0","created":1790006151491,"text":"下发"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dll4847dab40","created":1790006156786,"text":"撤回"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dll485g6yb40","created":1790006159496,"text":"多任务"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dll48gteujk0","created":1790006184240,"text":"密钥&签名"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dll47oh7me80","created":1790006122553,"text":"传输"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dll47tp5moo0","created":1790006133917,"text":"车端","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dll49jcx1eg0","created":1790006268137,"text":"异常恢复"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dll49ox96940","created":1790006280251,"text":"断网"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dll49q2dyzs0","created":1790006282738,"text":"断电"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dll49r4et5s0","created":1790006285037,"text":"弱网"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dll4a7uv2io0","created":1790006321465,"text":"断点续传"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dll4a3pzb1k0","created":1790006312463,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkps2a3qgg0","created":1789965403232,"text":"通信"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkps5ednw00","created":1789965410021,"text":"启动时序"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkps7pj8g80","created":1789965415049,"text":"状态机"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqbp3uqn40","created":1789966941841,"text":"hmi"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqbk1jmu80","created":1789966930816,"text":"uds诊断"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqbt7j0ps0","created":1789966950769,"text":"传感器"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqcsrlyg00","created":1789967028171,"text":"dds","layout_left_offset":{"x":-9.999999552965164,"y":-1.2499999441207592}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqd2bc7js0","created":1789967048955,"text":"日志","layout_left_offset":{"x":-3.7499998323619366,"y":0}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqd6xxns80","created":1789967059028,"text":"配置管理"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqd9c0otk0","created":1789967064233,"text":"售后大文件刷写"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqdjnxriw0","created":1789967086722,"text":"时间同步"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkqdobjlvc0","created":1789967096856,"text":"ap进程管理"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkpq25fq880","created":1789965246222,"text":"版本评测"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlkrsd5842o0","created":1789971069102,"text":"版本测试策略"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrsfg9g600","created":1789971074123,"text":"测试用例"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlkrshuvu140","created":1789971079361,"text":"测试报告"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkoq70ffa80","created":1789962435693,"text":"泊车感知评测","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djlc51wkun40","created":1782716168687,"text":"测试体系","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djlc6lrehuo0","created":1782716290273,"text":"传感器与数据理解","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djlc9153oo00","created":1782716480482,"text":"摄像头成像与标定原理"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djlc96zal280","created":1782716493191,"text":"超声波雷达工作原理"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djlc9fos7xs0","created":1782716512147,"text":"毫米波雷达工作原理"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djlc9r41klk0","created":1782716537014,"text":"激光雷达工作原理"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djlca5tuwy00","created":1782716569050,"text":"多传感器同步"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djlc5pysac00","created":1782716221063,"text":"感知算法基础"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djlcahghz8g0","created":1782716594364,"text":"计算机视觉原理","note":"通过传感器获取视觉信号并转换为数字矩阵，再利用深度学习与机器学习算法提取特征，从而实现从像素解析到高级语义的理解","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djld3fm4x080","created":1782718862912,"text":"核心工作流程","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djld3k4x9qw0","created":1782718872755,"text":"图像采集","note":"利用相机等传感器获取原始视觉信号（像素），并进行去噪、色彩转换和对比度增强等操作"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djld3nhppp40","created":1782718880059,"text":"特征提取","note":"算法（如卷积神经网络）从图像中提取边缘、纹理、形状等局部特征，再逐层抽象为全局特征"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djld3py6qq80","created":1782718885408,"text":"模型推理与决策","note":"借助深度学习模型对提取的特征进行分类、定位、分割或描述，完成预定任务"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djld4qo0daw0","created":1782718965334,"text":"基础任务"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djld4vd1vz40","created":1782718975555,"text":"图像分类（Image Classification）","note":"识别图像中主要物体的类别（例如识别图像是“猫”还是“狗”）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djld53ngzlk0","created":1782718993599,"text":"目标检测（Object Detection）","note":"识别图像中的特定目标，并用边界框（Bounding Box）标出其精确位置（如自动驾驶中的行人识别）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djld57crcv40","created":1782719001659,"text":"图像分割（Image Segmentation）","note":"将图像细分为多个区域或像素类别，提取目标轮廓（如医学图像中的病灶勾勒）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djld5ap8nug0","created":1782719008944,"text":"目标跟踪（Object Tracking）","note":"在视频序列中持续追踪特定目标，记录其运动轨迹（如智能安防中的人员追踪）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djld5f3t44w0","created":1782719018532,"text":"三维重建（3D Reconstruction）","note":"通过多视角图像或深度信息，恢复现实场景的三维立体结构"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djld5kdx2pk0","created":1782719030027,"text":"主流技术"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djld5pt6qgw0","created":1782719041834,"text":"卷积神经网络（CNN）","note":"计算机视觉的基石，通过卷积层模拟人类视觉的局部感知机制，擅长处理网格状的图像数据"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djld5xrx8ts0","created":1782719059172,"text":"视觉Transformer（ViT）","note":"基于自注意力机制，能够捕捉图像全局上下文信息，广泛应用于最新的前沿大模型中"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djld61l31z40","created":1782719067466,"text":"生成式视觉","note":"扩散模型（Diffusion Models）和生成对抗网络（GAN），能够根据文本或图像提示生成高质量的新图像"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"djlcak2rqjk0","created":1782716600064,"text":"传感器融合概念"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djlcao9xy3c0","created":1782716609205,"text":"目标检测与跟踪算法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djlcb0clsy80","created":1782716635487,"text":"SLAM （同步定位与建图"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djlc78s6xns0","created":1782716340387,"text":"测试环境与仿真"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djlcc5dn7x40","created":1782716724798,"text":"仿真平台、实车、台架环境搭建","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmezs88vnk0","created":1782825779090,"text":"车端部署"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmezxexveo0","created":1782825790379,"text":"云端部署"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djlcc9y1n200","created":1782716734739,"text":"数据采集与标注"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djlccmnzae00","created":1782716762428,"text":"回灌工具链","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmf02pg7kg0","created":1782825801898,"text":"环境初始化"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmf0p9nu8o0","created":1782825851009,"text":"数据初始化"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmf89jfxh40","created":1782826443685,"text":"个性化需求","layout_right_offset":{"x":4.999999776482582,"y":-11.249999497085867}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmf0tdkrmg0","created":1782825859953,"text":"业务运行","layout_right_offset":{"x":4.999999776482582,"y":-11.249999497085867}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmf9w0tq2o0","created":1782826570990,"text":"结果收集","layout_right_offset":{"x":4.999999776482582,"y":-11.249999497085867}},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"djlced6ma540","created":1782716898516,"text":"泊车功能场景","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djlcetsg4mw0","created":1782716934664,"text":"APA 自动泊车"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmfbj099so0","created":1782826699386,"text":"鱼眼障碍物"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmfbpg3dkg0","created":1782826713404,"text":"泊车bev"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmfbslnots0","created":1782826720271,"text":"泊车车位"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djlcexn4cf40","created":1782716943049,"text":"RPA 遥控泊车","layout_right_offset":{"x":6.249999720603341,"y":17.499999217689094}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djlcf2910o80","created":1782716953081,"text":"AVP 自主代客泊车"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmfcngwhmo0","created":1782826787463,"text":"3D occ（Occupancy Network）障碍物","note":"通过将三维空间切分成数以万计的微小方块（体素 Voxel），来预测每个方块是否被物体占用"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmfjady29c0","created":1782827307536,"text":"模型特点","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmfvzyi3m00","created":1782828303569,"text":"无视类型","note":"轻语义，重几何，检测该3D空间内是否有被占据；传统的3d识别需要先识别类型再输出3d框，容易漏检和误检"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmfyakitsw0","created":1782828483396,"text":"精细表达","note":"传统3D框一般多为标准长方体，对于不规则物体极其容易失真，occ将空间切割为3D网格，可以贴合描绘出任何异形、非刚体、可变形物体的细腻几何轮廓"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmg1338j0o0","created":1782828702206,"text":"三维感知","note":"传统BEV将3D压成2D的实现方式不同，occ具有高度信息，对限高杆等有高度的物体可以输出可通行信息"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmg445i04g0","created":1782828939612,"text":"计算量大","note":"从2维提升到3维对芯片算力和内存带宽消耗巨大，目前主流的做法是稀疏化"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djmfj2hhtnc0","created":1782827290336,"text":"测试设计","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmfr91h3tc0","created":1782827931518,"text":"场景设计","note":"依据模型应用场景和特性设计测试的场景，采集对应的场景数据"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmflj33kts0","created":1782827483199,"text":"指标设计","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djmfjhw20y80","created":1782827323868,"text":"测试实现"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmfsw3fa5c0","created":1782828060066,"text":"数据采集"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmft0m55200","created":1782828069905,"text":"数据标注","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djn5y30l1s00","created":1782901815810,"text":"4D标注","expandState":"collapse","note":"1、时空对齐：把一整条路测片段（如 30 秒的视频和点云）拼起来，利用高精定位（SLAM）和组合导航将所有帧的点云“缝合”成一个全局连续的 4D 静态世界大点云地图\n2、动态剔除：算法通过多帧前后追踪（Multi-frame Tracking），自动把路上行驶的背景车等动态物体的轨迹剥离出来。\n3、大模型预标注：用多视角大模型（如 NeRF、3DGS、自动标注大模型）直接将空间切碎为 4D 占用体素网格（Voxel Grid），或者自动生成连续的 3D 轨迹流。\n4、人工回放修剪：标注员不再一帧一帧画框，而是直接在时间轴上微调物体的轨迹曲线或修正立体空间的网格标签（占用/空闲"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djn6qs51auw0","created":1782904064696,"text":"优点","layout_right_offset":{"x":-8.333332753843706,"y":36.666664116912216}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djn6qtm8mn40","created":1782904067913,"text":"有时序信息","note":"不是单帧信息而是多帧缝合，多帧的点云根据时序信息融合在一起\n1、能解决短暂遮挡场景\n2、能解决不规则的异形物体"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djn6tdlf4bc0","created":1782904268127,"text":"精度更高","note":"抛弃了原有3D标注的方框概念，4D是将其切割成细小方块，为方块标注占据状态，对于异形物体的形状表达更精细"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djn705owunc0","created":1782904799473,"text":"缺点","layout_right_offset":{"x":-1.6666665507686957,"y":23.333331710762423}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djn70c8kluw0","created":1782904813723,"text":"标注成本高"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djn70erq5nk0","created":1782904819234,"text":"标注工具要求高"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"djn5wkitf6w0","created":1782901697190,"text":"鱼眼图像标注","note":"在图像上拉出边界线，然后通过内参矩阵进行坐标转换","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djn622bxcig0","created":1782902127776,"text":"优点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djn627py3so0","created":1782902139508,"text":"近距离覆盖范围广（0-6m"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djn62q0dxpk0","created":1782902179321,"text":"语义丰富，可标注类型多"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djn624j7rc00","created":1782902132570,"text":"缺点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djn62o8itmo0","created":1782902175459,"text":"图像远距离的像素差，会产生指数级的精度误差（大于15m"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djn639fwsdk0","created":1782902221619,"text":"只有2d信息，3D障碍物只能进行标注边缘，精度差"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djn64e3n5nk0","created":1782902310125,"text":"图像边缘畸变大，精度差"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djn6mmj33ds0","created":1782903739028,"text":"图像容易受光线影响"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"djn5y80eyqo0","created":1782901826684,"text":"激光3D标注","note":"标注工具加载 3D 点云图，标注员通过多视角（Top-View 鸟瞰图、Front-View 前视图、3D 渲染图）联动，用鼠标选中点云簇，为其包裹一个 3D 长方体框（Bounding Box，含长宽高、中心点坐标、航向角 Roll/Pitch/Yaw）\t","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djn6hikgw940","created":1782903338584,"text":"优点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djn6lj1hcio0","created":1782903653069,"text":"激光点云的精度更高"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djn6lyrx2i00","created":1782903687319,"text":"激光不受光线变化影响"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djn6hldvfd40","created":1782903344715,"text":"缺点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djn6my30two0","created":1782903764178,"text":"语义信息匮乏，无法区分类型以及细微的轮廓特征"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djn6nui0xjc0","created":1782903834742,"text":"随着距离增加，点云会变得稀疏，远距离物体难以判断物理边界"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"djmft6t9wx40","created":1782828083397,"text":"真值处理","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djn8unwrd6o0","created":1782910011165,"text":"真值下载"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djna13pk5g80","created":1782913336853,"text":"真值过滤","note":"因为真值标注结果、范围可能较大，全部加载浪费资源，按需加载使用的真值","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djnatadqc0o0","created":1782915545571,"text":"真值插值（上采样","note":"为什么：\n\t对于点数少但是很长的障碍物  遮挡计算和位置计算更精准\n\n怎么做：\n\t需要对目标障碍物点进行插值 做一个稠密化操作 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djnbhll9w8o0","created":1782917450712,"text":"FOV过滤","expandState":"collapse","note":"为什么：\n\t判断障碍物是否在可视范围内，过滤不在可视范围内的障碍物\n    \n怎么做：\n\t通过判断障碍物的几何形状与传感器的FOV是否相交"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djnadu88ugo0","created":1782914334949,"text":"获取传感器外参","note":"通过配置文件读取读取相机fov角度、朝向、可视距离等"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djnae8xypdc0","created":1782914366979,"text":"极坐标转换生成多边形区域","note":"利用三角函数将极坐标转换成直角坐标\n\n直角坐标系 (X, Y)：\n\t通过横坐标和纵坐标定位。\n\n极坐标系 (R, theta)：\n\t通过距离圆心的半径(R)和与正 X 轴的夹角(theta)定位\n\n余弦函数 (cos)：\n\t邻边=斜边*cos(theta)\n\n正弦函数 (sin)：\n\t对边=斜边*sin(theta)\n    \n斜边就是圆的半径 (R)，那么这个点的直角坐标就是\n\tx=R*con(theta)\n    y=R*sin(theta)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djnbicy6eso0","created":1782917510265,"text":"FOV之外过滤","note":"1、通过障碍物点与FOV区域是否有交集进行粗筛\n2、计算障碍物与多边形的IOU比例，比例过小说明大部分在可视范围外"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dk3yl8o3hi00","created":1784607580876,"text":"边缘过滤","note":"为什么：\n\t有些障碍物部分在fov中，处于fov中物体比例太小时认为该物体其实是看不见的\n\n怎么做：\n\t计算障碍物点落在FOV中的比例，过滤比例低的障碍物点"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djnbiqh7v0g0","created":1782917539715,"text":"遮挡过滤","note":"为什么：\n\t有的障碍物之间会互相遮挡，或者柱子可能标注了好几面，但是后面的柱子车辆根本不可视，需要过滤\n    \n怎么做：\n\t通过射线投射法，判断每个障碍物点是否被其他物体遮挡，遮挡比例高的障碍物认为不可见，过滤掉","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djnbygw2pnc0","created":1782918772672,"text":"目标遮挡过滤","note":"1、从传感器中心引出与目标障碍物点连接的线段\n2、判断线段是否与其他障碍物相交\n3、相交则证明目标障碍物该点被遮挡","expandState":"expand"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djnc47wkl0g0","created":1782919223296,"text":"自身遮挡过滤","note":"1、障碍物点与传感器中心的连线与自身交集点大于1则该点被自身遮挡\n2、顺序遍历遮挡和未遮挡点\n3、通过遮挡和非遮挡的状态切换将遮挡点和未遮挡点进行分类\n4、设置遮挡的长度或者面积限制（算法理应有小遮挡的是识别能力）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djnbw3bmmkw0","created":1782918586409,"text":"白名单保留","note":"某些类型如墙、柱子 因为高度较高 一般不会存在遮挡情况 需要额外保留"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djnbhoxw26g0","created":1782917458005,"text":"类型过滤","note":"为什么:\n\t标注类型过多，实际使用较少，全部计算耗时大\n    \n怎么做：\n\t标注结果可能比需求类型多，对不需要评测的类型进行过滤"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djo3brptdqo0","created":1782995984940,"text":"真值抽稀（降采样","note":"为什么：\n\t如果稠密化的结果全部传递给后端消耗太大\n    \n怎么做：\n\t只保留弯曲、拐角时的关键点能有效降低数据量"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djmgdixb4a00","created":1782829677046,"text":"坐标转换","expandState":"expand","note":"真值标注是自车坐标系下的 算法结果是基于odom坐标系下的 所以需要先进行一个坐标转换\t"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djo4gisgy140","created":1782999178440,"text":"对齐时间戳","note":"目的：\n\t将真值转换成odom坐标系下的坐标\n\n问题：\n\t1.坐标转换需要用到自车的定位信息\n\t2.真值是通过图像获得然后进行标注的\n\t3.通常图像的帧率比定位低的多，而且标注进行抽帧\n\n解决：\n\t通过真值的时间戳找前后一定阈值内的定位信息进行匹配\n"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl3zez4cd6w0","created":1788266069455,"text":"相机坐标系转图像坐标系","note":"\n"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlhggva75mo0","created":1789634456136,"text":"图像转BEV"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlhh836tkf40","created":1789636589178,"text":"构建齐次变换矩阵","note":"智能驾驶中相机的标定结果如果被转化为四元数，需要将四元数转换成齐次变换矩阵进行后续计算\n"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlhh8q29erk0","created":1789636638968,"text":" "},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djo4thbkfog0","created":1783000193976,"text":"自车坐标系转odom坐标系"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"djmgdsbba1s0","created":1782829697484,"text":"数据处理","layout_right_offset":{"x":-3.3333331015373915,"y":-1.6666665507686957},"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djn786p0va00","created":1782905428570,"text":"解析评测DB3文件","note":"官方标准通过 rosbag2_py 提供的 Reader进行数据处理","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djn8kdwk3zc0","created":1782909205743,"text":"实例化官方 Reader ","note":"reader = rosbag2_py.SequentialReader()"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djn8lu4slko0","created":1782909319434,"text":"设置存储选项","note":"指定路径和后端格式（ROS 2 默认是 sqlite3，新版本也支持 mcap）\n        storage_options = rosbag2_py.StorageOptions(\n            uri=self.bag_dir_path, \n            storage_id=\"sqlite3\"\n        )"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djn8m6tx3mw0","created":1782909347074,"text":"设置转换选项","note":"读取原始序列化数据（保持 CDR 编码）\n        converter_options = rosbag2_py.ConverterOptions(\n            input_serialization_format=\"cdr\",\n            output_serialization_format=\"cdr\"\n        )"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djn8mg9f9ls0","created":1782909367603,"text":"打开 Bag 文件","note":"reader.open(storage_options, converter_options)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djn8moyzbn40","created":1782909386562,"text":"获取 Bag 内所有话题的元数据","note":"建立“话题名”到“消息类型字符串”的映射字典\n        topic_types = reader.get_all_topics_and_types()\n        type_map = {topic.name: topic.type for topic in topic_types}\n"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djn8n2couiw0","created":1782909415689,"text":"过滤报文（非必须","note":"如果配置了目标话题，设置过滤器以提高读取性能\n        if self.target_topics:\n            filter_options = rosbag2_py.StorageFilter(topics=self.target_topics)\n            reader.set_filter(filter_options)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djn8og0e5940","created":1782909523785,"text":"循环读取报文","note":"        while reader.has_next():\n            # 读取下一条原始报文：包含话题名、二进制数据、时间戳\n            topic_name, raw_data, timestamp = reader.get_next_message()\n            msg_type_str = type_map.get(topic_name)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djn8p7zfevc0","created":1782909584677,"text":"反序列化","note":"\n                msg_class = get_message(msg_type_str)\n                msg_obj = deserialize_message(raw_data, msg_class)\n                msg_dict = message_to_ordereddict(msg_obj)"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"djmftl2tew80","created":1782828114449,"text":"评测计算"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmfu63ne8g0","created":1782828160212,"text":"结果汇总"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"djmfcrhv5jc0","created":1782826796229,"text":"园区boundary"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmfdm6ruhk0","created":1782826863038,"text":"中心线"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmfdvj4uzk0","created":1782826883377,"text":"引导线"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmfel2n13s0","created":1782826938976,"text":"室内外识别"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmff3llb3c0","created":1782826979304,"text":"出入口识别"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmffct3eq80","created":1782826999349,"text":"进出园区切图"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmffmy8zds0","created":1782827021428,"text":"VLM找出口"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmffx44ns00","created":1782827043551,"text":"导航功能","note":"扎标、切图、重规划、重导航、默认目的地、切换目的地、目的地优先级、能源车位"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"djlc57vs9nk0","created":1782716181699,"text":"工作内容","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djlcg6r62jk0","created":1782717041249,"text":"版本交付","note":"1、分析版本用途&交付范围，设计版本总体评测策略以及需求验收策略\n2、构建版本冒烟用例、快评集、细分场景集以及cornercase集\n3、评测分层，分析版本用途和转测时间设计合理测试规模，高效满足版本迭代需求，及时拦截算法模型&需求问题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmcfmhs5m80","created":1782818557103,"text":"版本类型","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmbzsjljv40","created":1782817316447,"text":"重要伐点版本","note":"验证内容&通过标准\n1、依据伐点的功能交付范围进行全量功能验证，交付功能达到需求准出标准\n2、验证算法性能满足准出标准\n3、系统基础性能、稳定性等符合交付规格\n4、单点问题修复验证通过，无负向收益（负收益不予通过\n\n特殊情况：\n需要分析负收益的影响范围、场景以及概率等进行决策，决策问题遗留需要有问题根因分析，问题解决方案以及问题修复计划\n"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmbzxqvtxc0","created":1782817327771,"text":"日常迭代版本","note":"验证内容&通过标准\n1、新增功能验证，需求满足交付标准\n2、基础功能冒烟，验证基础功能完善\n3、修复问题验证，正收益大于负收益（负收益需要有修复计划）\n\n"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmc055h4w00","created":1782817343891,"text":"临时测试版本","note":"主要针对单点的临时问题验证或者方案验证"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djmcfs5edcg0","created":1782818569415,"text":"交付件","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmcg2hhfz40","created":1782818591913,"text":"测试策略","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmcgif2rso0","created":1782818626596,"text":"测试范围&目标","note":"1、明确版本用途和本次测试覆盖范围\n2、明确版本交付范围内所需达到的质量标准"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmcgr8r0tc0","created":1782818645805,"text":"测试环境&数据","note":"说明测试环境和测试数据的来源以及测试数据量"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djmcg5zkf740","created":1782818599537,"text":"测试报告","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmclua2zxk0","created":1782819044236,"text":"报告概述","note":"1、报告名称\n2、版本信息\n3、测试时间\n4、测试结论"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmcmpfpwls0","created":1782819112057,"text":"测试情况","note":"1、需求验收结果\n2、感知性能评估指标\n3、系统性能&稳定性指标\n4、负收益影响分析、场景分析、概率分析（如有）\n5、竞品对比报告（如有）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmcnx3s10o0","created":1782819207114,"text":"遗留问题&风险分析","note":"1、新增&遗留问题汇总\n2、遗留问题风险点&规避措施"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"djlcgf16qwg0","created":1782717059269,"text":"模型迭代","note":"验证上线模型的性能优化&问题修复结果"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmcpxd99g80","created":1782819364415,"text":"模型评测方案","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmec85dyiw0","created":1782823933006,"text":"测试方案设计","note":"依据模型特性和功能应用场景设计测试方案和相应的测试指标"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmec85dyiw0","created":1782823933006,"text":"测试场景设计","note":"依据模型应用场景和特性设计测试的场景，采集对应的场景数据"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmecd3yf5k0","created":1782823943804,"text":"评测代码开发","note":"依据测试设计进行对应指标的开发"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djmecn36p400","created":1782823965524,"text":"用例集构建","note":"模型不同的迭代范围和程度对测试用例集进行不同量级的划分，快速高效的发现问题，主要应该包括以下层级\n1、后冒烟用例集（1h-2h），旨在快速评定模型基本功能和基础性能指标\n2、快评集（4h-8h），适量基础场景数据，评定模型基本场景和日常工况下的性能指标\n3、全量集（8h-24h），全量场景和极端工况下的测试数据，全面评定模型各个场景和工况下的性能指标\n4、专项集（1h-8h），针对模型特点或者专项优化场景设计的数据集合，可能是某个专项场景、可能是模型误检、可能是问题数据等"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djlcgu6nzko0","created":1782717092252,"text":"功能需求","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmcxxdasbk0","created":1782819991331,"text":"需求串讲","note":"se串讲需求设计思路、功能逻辑和交付规格等"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmcy3566w80","created":1782820003900,"text":"测试设计","note":"依据设计文档进行测试设计，包括\n1、需求分析，明确功能边界，对需求范围内进行功能点映射\n2、测试场景设计，通过功能的设计理念抽象出使用场景然后进行实例化的具体场景设计\n3、软硬件接口与系统性能稳定性设计\n4、预期输出&测试指标\n5、故障注入、极端工况"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmd4iyymy80","created":1782820508538,"text":"反串讲","note":"同se与开发进行测试设计串讲，对齐测试用例、测试范围、准出标准等"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmcya6ubk80","created":1782820019239,"text":"测试执行","note":"1、依据测试设计生成测试用例\n2、依据测试用例进行进行测试执行\n3、记录测试用例执行情况、结果、问题"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmcyc1u3cw0","created":1782820023290,"text":"测试报告","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmclua2zxk0","created":1782819044236,"text":"报告概述","note":"1、报告名称\n2、版本信息\n3、测试时间\n4、测试结论"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmcmpfpwls0","created":1782819112057,"text":"测试情况","note":"1、需求验收结果\n2、感知性能评估指标\n3、系统性能&稳定性指标\n4、负收益影响分析、场景分析、概率分析（如有）\n5、竞品对比报告（如有）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmcnx3s10o0","created":1782819207114,"text":"遗留问题&风险分析","note":"1、新增&遗留问题汇总\n2、遗留问题风险点&规避措施"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"djlch05uwn40","created":1782717105264,"text":"多车型交付"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmdilam5u00","created":1782821610695,"text":"车型数据","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmdj3hqm9s0","created":1782821650308,"text":"场景设计","note":"依据新车型的传感器部署、硬件规格、底软&平台能力等非算法相关的差异化部分进行分析，设计评估新车型的算法性能需要的评测场景和数据量"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmdj50zcqo0","created":1782821653648,"text":"数据采集"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"djmdizpomvs0","created":1782821642081,"text":"车型报告","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djmdj85ouvk0","created":1782821660463,"text":"评测执行"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djmdjlnggwo0","created":1782821689836,"text":"问题分析&优化","note":"分析评测结果，提取不符合预期的场景数据，分析影响因素，推动算法优化"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlkprnbutkg0","created":1789965370687,"text":"测试体系"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djlc5nb8cww0","created":1782716215285,"text":"软件测试理论基础","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"djlc859p07k0","created":1782716411103,"text":"测试流程与生命周期"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djlc86ot9ls0","created":1782716414193,"text":"测试用例设计方法"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djlc89nzuq80","created":1782716420674,"text":"缺陷管理流程"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"djlc8ds5qd40","created":1782716429633,"text":"测试工具"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}